.TH WERKMEISTER-PROXY-RELOAD 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-proxy\-reload \- Regenerate Caddyfile and reload Caddy
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister proxy\-reload\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Reads all active slot assignments, regenerates \fB~/.werkmeister/infra/proxy/Caddyfile\fR, and reloads (or starts) Caddy. Useful after manual config changes or if the proxy gets out of sync.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
